        </ul>
        <p>Our total aggregate liability to you shall not exceed the total subscription amount paid by you in the 12 months immediately preceding the claim.</p>

        <h2>11. How can a Zipla POS account be terminated?</h2>
        <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> You may stop using Zipla POS at any time and request account deletion by email. These Terms also list the situations in which Zipla may suspend or terminate an account.</p>

        <h3>How can you end your account?</h3>
        <p>You may stop using Zipla POS at any time. To delete your account and data, email us at <a href="mailto:support@zipla.in">support@zipla.in</a>. Subscription fees already paid are non-refundable beyond the 7-day refund window.</p>

